flowchart TD
  E[Requirement + source diff + test receipt] --> S[Screen and validate]
  S --> J[Jev semantic judgments]
  J --> D{Tests and syntax pass, tests ran, revision matches, receipt fresh?}
  D -->|No| B[BLOCK regardless of favorable judgment]
  D -->|Yes| Q{Semantic evidence meets configured thresholds?}
  Q -->|Clear failure| B
  Q -->|Uncertain| R[REVIEW: collect evidence or escalate]
  Q -->|Yes| P[CHECKS_PASSED on supplied evidence]
  P --> H[Ordinary approvals still required]
